cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: st-compare
abstract: 'Compares spatial transcriptomics samples between conditions, per label (spatial domain or cell type): label composition
  per sample with per-label tests on centred log-ratio proportions, and pseudobulk differential expression per label with
  PyDESeq2 (DESeq2), with the sample as the replicate. Writes result tables, composition boxplots, volcano plots, a DE heatmap
  and JSON summaries.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-compare
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- transcriptomics
- genomics
- differential-expression
- differential-abundance
- pseudobulk
- DESeq2
- compositional-data
